# Transient run artifacts -- regenerated locally, not version-controlled. Keep
# the folders (via .gitkeep) so a fresh clone has them ready, but ignore their
# (potentially large) contents.
state/*
cache/*
logs/*
!state/.gitkeep
!cache/.gitkeep
!logs/.gitkeep
T3BrapiHelpers_extraction_proposal.md
.Renviron
.Rprofile
settings.local.R
EM_COMBINE_COMPARISON.md
CODE_ASSESSMENT.md
NEXT_STEPS.md
USDA_ARS_SCINET.md
nohup.out
# Cluster packaging: specific to one person's SciNet/BioHPC accounts, not to the algorithm.
# NOTE: being ignored, `git pull` does NOT deliver these to a build host -- scp the folder.
# container/
